          "id": "1",
          "name": "index.html",
          "contents": "Skateboarding\n\nHistory\nSkateboarding started in the 1950s when surfers in California wanted something to do when the waves were flat. It grew from a backyard hobby into a global sport, officially becoming an Olympic event in 2021.\n\nStyles\nThere are many ways to skate. Street skating uses urban environments like stairs and rails. Park skating takes place in bowls and ramps. Freestyle skating focuses on flat-ground tricks and creativity.",
